,"/farmland-atlas/washington/garfield-county"],["ARC or PLC in Garfield County","/arc-plc/washington/garfield-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids July to August and August to September each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 17% of normal in June to July and 33% in May to June 2025. So far in 2026 the middle ran 179% of normal in February to March 2026, then fell to 31% in June to July 2026.</p>"}
